'''God of War - Odin''' (軍神オーディン, ''Gunshin Ōdin'') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Yurudrasil Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 4.4 Update|Version 4.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = God of War - Odin
|appearance = [[Yurudrasil Collaboration Event]]
|image = E 204.png
|money drop = 2,500円 - 9,875円
}}

==Enemy==
Extremely high health, somewhat average attack, large range and slow speed. This enemy isn't much to worry about if you know what you're dealing with. His slow speed makes his advance to the base very sluggish as well as his twelve second TBA. This enemy also has no special abilities to help him advance makes him nothing but at backliner that does barely anything.

==Strategy==
There's the obvious choice of Cat Units that outrange him such as [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Hacker Cat]] which will also help on his debut stage where he is supported by other Yurudrasil enemies, however if your [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] are around about level 50, you can conquer his stage with just [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|three]] [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|normal]] [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|units]]!

